    "name": "Phase 4.6 — Mentor teaching workspace",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Local verified; not deployed. No auto mutation runner. Login cookies are kept by Postman. For every note save read version, set a UUIDv4 idempotency_key; identical network retry reuses exact key/body. Units and sessions are separately paginated. Substitute has no class reports/progress/authoring."
